WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.739
Cat looked all over.

2
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:22.814
Cow looked all over.

3
00:00:22.815 --> 00:00:27.969
They did not see anything blue.

4
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:34.450
They did not see anything new.

5
00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:37.952
Then Cat saw something.

6
00:00:37.953 --> 00:00:42.910
"There it is!" she said.

7
00:00:42.911 --> 00:00:47.064
"It is blue and it is new!

8
00:00:47.065 --> 00:00:50.588
It is a wagon!"

9
00:00:50.589 --> 00:00:54.689
"I am too big to ride," said Cow.

10
00:00:54.690 --> 00:01:00.104
"But I can pull!"

11
00:01:00.105 --> 00:01:20.550
Cow pulled and pulled.

12
00:01:20.551 --> 00:01:27.638
Then Pig pulled and pulled.

13
00:01:27.639 --> 00:01:38.425
The three friends went round and round.

14
00:01:38.426 --> 00:01:43.105
"Look!" said Cat. "Over there!

15
00:01:43.106 --> 00:01:51.228
I see something blue again!"

16
00:01:51.229 --> 00:01:54.619
"I see something yellow," said Pig.

17
00:01:54.620 --> 00:02:00.124
"I see something red and green," said Cow.

18
00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:03.565
The three friends went out of the barn.

19
00:02:03.566 --> 00:02:08.203
They looked up.

20
00:02:08.204 --> 00:02:10.677
The sky was blue.

21
00:02:10.678 --> 00:02:15.956
And there was a rainbow!

